  "title": "Allarity Therapeutics Granted FDA Fast Track Designation for Stenoparib for the Treatment of Advanced Ovarian Cancer - Allarity Therapeutics",
  "summary": "TARPON SPRINGS, Fla., August 26, 2025 — Allarity Therapeutics, Inc. (“Allarity” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: ALLR), a Phase 2 clinical-stage pharmaceutical company dedicated to developing stenoparib—a differentiated, dual PARP and WNT pathway inhibitor—today announced that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has granted Fast Track designation to stenoparib, its investigational treatment for […]",
